      "message": "I agree, the new rule:admin_on_domain_filter is NOT equivalent to the previous policy. And I agree with what you\u0027re saying, the change does not eliminate any redundancy within rule:admin_on_domain_filter - indeed there never was redundancy in there. \n\nThe intention of this change is to remove the redundant appearance of rule:cloud_admin within the below rule identity:list_role_assignments. Currently rule:cloud_admin is in there twice because rule:cloud_admin is included in both of its sub-rules, admin_on_domain_filter and admin_on_project_filter. The change removes rule:cloud_admin from each of the sub-rules, and includes it once directly in the main rule.",
